<title>AUSTRALIA: Metway confirms A$100 mln debt issue.</title>
<headline>Metway confirms A$100 mln debt issue.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metway Bank confirmed on Thursday that it has issued a A$100 million bond maturing on July 15, 1999 through Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p>The bonds carry a 6.0 percent coupon and were priced at 38 basis points over the July 1999 government bond to yield around 6.24 percent, a Metway official said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800.</p>
</text>
